    "layer_2": "implemented",
    "notes": [
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Salary model: split. base_salary = retribuzione base nazionale conglobata (Tabella A, Art. 58). fixed_allowances = contingenza (per-level, frozen since 1977 per settore commercio) + EDR 10.33 (all levels, accordo 31/07/1992) + ISQ (Q levels, Tabella C)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Divisore convenzionale 173 confirmed from Art. 57 of primary CCNL text."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Additional months: 14. Art. 62 (13a mensilita) and Art. 63 (14a mensilita) confirmed from primary source."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Seniority: 15 scatti biennali (Art. 53). Amounts from Tabella D (1.2.1996 column) of primary CCNL PDF."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Contract expired 31/08/2024 (Art. 102). No successor signed as of 2026-09-05 (INPS-CNEL spreadsheet updated 25/07/2026 shows Periodo finale=null for H121). Tables valid open-ended under ultrattività."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Apprenticeship from Accordo 14 giugno 2012 (Allegato II). Farmacista collaboratore (dest 1o) stays at level 1o for all 36 months. Commesso/Magazziniere/Contabile (dest 4o): months 0-12 at level 6o, months 13-36 at level 5o."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Headcount: 77,146 workers in 16,324 companies (INPS-CNEL archive, H121)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "SIMPLIFICATION: Farmacie Rurali Sussidiate (Tabella B) excluded. Rural pharmacies have lower base salaries; Tabella A (urban) is modelled only."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "SIMPLIFICATION: ISQ for Q2 and Q3 modelled at 100 EUR with service_months_threshold=24 (minimum for 2+ anni in Area Q, Tabella C). Workers with 12+ anni receive 130 EUR (delta 30 EUR/month, max ~360 EUR/yr). The threshold gates correctly to zero below 24 months; the 100 vs 130 split at 144 months is not representable with a single fixed_allowance amount."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "SIMPLIFICATION: EDR (10.33 EUR, Art. 54e) is contractually due for 13 mensilita but the engine multiplies fixed_allowances by additional_months=14. Annual overcount ~10 EUR per worker."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "SIMPLIFICATION: Tabella D groups Q2, Q3, and 1o into a single scatto amount of 25.30 EUR. Q1 uses 25.82 EUR."
      }
    ]
  },
